# Build context hygiene for deploy/Dockerfile.
#
# This file must live at the CONTEXT root (the repo root), not next to the
# Dockerfile — that is where every docker/buildkit/podman version looks for it.
#
# The Dockerfile also COPYs explicit paths rather than `COPY . .`, so this is
# defence in depth: it keeps secrets and bulk out of the tarball that is
# uploaded to the daemon in the first place.

.git
.gitignore

# THE VAULT: real notes, .znotes/settings.toml, the passphrase-wrapped
# identity, and the sqlite index that holds the GitHub token and AI key.
# Nothing here may ever enter an image layer.
vault/
vaults/
**/.znotes/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

node_modules/
dist/

tests/
.scratch/
docs/
# safe to exclude: the file named by `-f` and this file are always sent to the
# builder regardless of the ignore list
deploy/

.DS_Store
*.log
